cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If using this proof archive, please cite it."
title: "Thirty-Point Conditional Positivity for a Spherical Quartic and a 58-Point Counterexample"
authors:
  - given-names: Yongxian
    family-names: Zhang
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "For at most thirty unit vectors the quartic kernel is positive on mass-zero directions. The worst 60-degree mixed energy through thirty points is attained in dimension n minus 2. An explicit 58-point code violates the positivity condition, not the rank conclusion."
